                                                                        "parts":  [
                                                                                      "Implemented the refresh-speed change in led_blinky.c only.\n\nThe game now uses dirty-rectangle rendering instead of clearing and repainting the full LCD every frame. It only erases/redraws the previous pipe, current pipe, previous bird, current bird, score area, and game-over overlay when needed. I also reduced GAME_FRAME_DELAY_US from 30000U to 16000U for a more responsive loop.\n\nVerification passed:\n\ncmake --build --preset debug\n\nIt rebuilt and linked new.elf successfully. No .mex or generated frdmmcxa153/ files were edited."
