                                                        "content":  {
                                                                        "content_type":  "text",
                                                                        "parts":  [
                                                                                      "Implemented the responsiveness pass in the application-owned files only:\n\n- led_blinky.c\n  - Larger 22x18 bird with beak, wing, eye, and inset collision box.\n  - Held SW2 now applies continuous lift, not just a tap impulse.\n  - Stronger gravity and faster loop timing.\n  - Wider pipe gap to keep the larger bird playable.\n  - Pipe rendering now uses narrow trailing/leading strips during normal scrolling instead of full pipe redraws.\n  - Score redraw is reduced instead of forced every frame.\n\n- app/ili9341.c\n  - Increased ili9341_fill_rect() transfer buffer from 64 to 256 bytes to reduce blocking SPI transfer overhead.\n\nVerification passed:\n\ncmake --build --preset debug\n\nNo .mex or generated frdmmcxa153/ files were edited. The remaining likely tuning knob on hardware is feel: GAME_FLAP_HOLD_ACCEL_Q8, GAME_GRAVITY_Q8, and GAME_PIPE_GAP are now set to reasonable first-pass values but may want small tweaks after trying the board."
